# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify 形式。HTMLとService Workerは毎回更新確認、ハッシュ付き資産は長期キャッシュ。
/
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/build-info.json
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/precache.json
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: no-cache
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
